# Behavior Snapshots are written with "\n" by tests/behavior/regenerate.py, and
# "make snapshots" must leave the tree clean when nothing changed. Under a
# global core.autocrlf=true the checkout would carry CRLF, so every regeneration
# would report the whole corpus as modified with an empty diff. Pin the working
# copy to LF so the gate's cleanliness signal stays trustworthy.
*.json text eol=lf
